---
import { ArrowRight } from "lucide-react"

const plans = [
  { name: "Free", price: "$0", minutes: "30", overage: "None" },
  {
    name: "Starter",
    price: "$30 a month",
    minutes: "150",
    overage: "$0.20 a minute",
  },
  {
    name: "Pro",
    price: "$100 a month",
    minutes: "500",
    overage: "$0.18 a minute",
  },
]
---

<section class="border-t border-border/40 py-20 md:py-28" id="cost">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-16"
  >
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-heading">
        What an after-hours answering service costs
      </h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Live answering services usually bill per minute or per call, and some
        add setup or holiday fees. LobbyStack charges a flat monthly plan with
        minutes included, and nights, weekends, and holidays cost the same as
        any other hour.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-muted/40 p-5">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Example</p>
        <p class="body-copy mt-2 text-base">
          You get 40 after-hours calls a month and each one lasts about 3
          minutes. That's 120 minutes, which fits in Starter for $30. Spam calls
          and calls under 10 seconds don't count.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm font-medium">
        <a
          href="/pricing/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-foreground"
        >
          Compare plans <ArrowRight className="size-3.5" aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
        <a
          href="/missed-call-revenue-calculator/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-foreground"
        >
          Estimate what missed calls cost you
          <ArrowRight className="size-3.5" aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="self-center overflow-x-auto rounded-[1.35rem] border border-border/70"
    >
      <table class="w-full min-w-[480px] border-collapse text-left text-sm">
        <caption class="sr-only"
          >LobbyStack plans for after-hours answering</caption
        >
        <thead class="bg-muted/50">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-4 font-medium text-foreground"
              >Plan</th
            >
            <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-4 font-medium text-foreground"
              >Price</th
            >
            <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-4 font-medium text-foreground">
              Minutes included
            </th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-4 font-medium text-foreground">
              Extra minutes
            </th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            plans.map((plan) => (
              <tr class="border-t border-border/60">
                <th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-medium text-foreground">
                  {plan.name}
                </th>
                <td class="px-6 py-5 text-foreground">{plan.price}</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-5 text-foreground tabular-nums">
                  {plan.minutes}
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-5 text-muted-foreground">{plan.overage}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p
        class="border-t border-border/60 px-6 py-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground"
      >
        Free has no phone number, so use it to test LobbyStack before you
        forward calls. Starter and Pro include a dedicated number, and annual
        billing costs $288 or $960 a year.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
